// # NIST Post-Quantum Cryptography Master Facade
//
// Logline: Unified master entry point and API re-exporting FIPS 203 (ML-KEM), FIPS 204 (ML-DSA), FIPS 205 (SLH-DSA), Falcon, and Hybrid PQC modules.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim importing all companion NIST Post-Quantum cryptography submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular FIPS 203, FIPS 204, FIPS 205, Falcon, Stateful HSS, and Hybrid protocol submodules.
//   2. Re-export public default parameters, engine initializers, and runtime configurations.
//   3. Maintain unified high-level access points for openOODA post-quantum cryptographic consumers.

